  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk | Hampton, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n\t\t\t Notify Me® \r\n     Town Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     Community Outreach   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \nHome \nTown Departments \nTown Clerk \r\nNEW TOWN CLERK HOURS \nMONDAY - WEDNESDAY 8 AM - 5 PM \nTHURSDAY 8 AM - 6 PM \n FRIDAY 8 AM - 11:30 AM \nTown Clerk \nThe Town Clerk was the first official appointed by the colonists when they established the town in 1638. At that time the clerk was responsible for writing and recording all the town records. Those records still exist and provide an accurate description of life in the colonies. \nDuties Today \nToday, the duties of the clerk have changed greatly, although one duty is still maintaining town records. We also serve as the local registrar, issuing marriage licenses and copies of birth, marriage, and death records. \nWe register motor vehicles, boats,  OHRV s and issue hunting and fishing licenses as well as license dogs. The office collects over four million dollars annually, in taxes and fees for both town and state. \nIn addition, we handle all phases of federal, state and local elections, from registering new voters, issuing absentee ballots, taking official minutes, printing ballots, to recording and certifying the votes. \nThe Town Clerks office offers Notary Public service as a convenience. We will notarize up to 3 documents per visit. We do NOT however, notarize Mortgage documents, Estate documents, Will and Testament documents or any form of medical directive. \nIf you are in need of Justice of the Peace services, we offer a list of local JP's in our office. Stop by to get a copy which includes contact information for each of them. \nAuto Registration  \nRenew your cars online with  E-Register . \nOne-check registration is here! Pay your auto registrations with one check only (no need to write two separate checks any longer!). \nPayable to Town of Hampton \nNow accepting credit cards! (2.99% convenience fee added) \nThere’s an  ATM  in our lobby if you wish to pay cash ($2.50 fee and limit of $300 per transaction) \nResident Decals \nCheck out the new designer  Resident Decals ! \nThe decals are $10 each and they support Hampton Recreation Scholarship Fund. Call Town Clerk for more information. \nTown Clerk Documents \nView  documents from the Town Clerk department . \r\nContact Us \r\nTown Clerk \r\nEmail the Town Clerk \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n\t\t\t\t\t 100 Winnacunnet Road \n\t\t\t\t\t Hampton ,  NH   03842 \r\nPhone:  603-926-0406 \r\nFax: 603-929-5917 \r\nOffice Hours \nMonday thru Wednesday \n 8am - 5pm   \n Thursday \n 8am - 6pm \nFriday \n 8am - 11:30am \nDirectory \r\n\t\t\t Directions \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Elections \r\n\t\t\t Forms \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle Registration \r\n\t\t\t Renewals \r\n\t\t\t Online Services \r\n\t\t\t Conducting business with the Town Clerk's Office \r\n\t\t\t Supervisors of the Checklist \r\n\t\t\t Town Moderator \r\n\t\t\t Marriage License Notice \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Pay Online \r\n\t\t\t Hampton TV Channel 22 \r\n\t\t\t Trash & Recycling \r\n\t\t\t Property Information \r\n\t\t\t Employment \r\nContact Us \r\nThe Town of Hampton \n100 Winnacunnet Road \nHampton, NH 03842 \nPhone:  603-926-6766 \nFax:  603-926-6853 \r\nFrequently Asked Questions \r\n         U.S. Department of Homeland Security \n         American Red Cross \n         Ready.gov Website \n         Federal Emergency Management Agency \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nHelpful Links \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Contact Us \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n         Town Employee Email \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
